     "type": "p",
     "text": {
      "zh": "{{t:zygentoma}}以前叫 Thysanura，来自希腊文 thysanos（缨）加 oura（尾），指尾端的三条长丝。",
      "en": "{{t:zygentoma}} used to be called Thysanura, from the Greek thysanos (fringe) and oura (tail), after the three long tail threads.",
      "ms": "{{t:zygentoma}} dahulu dipanggil Thysanura, daripada bahasa Yunani thysanos (jumbai) dan oura (ekor), merujuk tiga ekor panjang."
     },
     "defines": [
      "zygentoma"
     ],
     "src": [
      "LSJ",
      "WTK:10"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
